      "writtenOn": "2022-09-08T13:49:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I also started noodling through \"what if we got rid of this bit completely\" but I haven\u0027t fully thought through the consequences. There are definitely going to be ripple effects, hopefully net-positive ones.\n\nMaybe we need to stop inferring \"this is an intrinsic\" and explicitly spell it out. It would be a hassle to implement, but what if every intrinsic had `layout(intrinsicKind\u003d123)` attached?",
      "parentUuid": "1466747d_a2af6c20",
      "revId": "e642e21d20391a291cb2da1519b85e7ba9bd3ab9",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
