      "writtenOn": "2022-09-08T13:52:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That sounds like a possible fallback (and it would be nice to have that information properly encoded in the IR). I feel like checking for a definition is a possible answer (though I realize it may not work correctly - if we\u0027re parsing at any point between the prototype and definition of a function, we\u0027ll get the wrong answer).",
      "parentUuid": "ad17c905_146d547d",
      "revId": "e642e21d20391a291cb2da1519b85e7ba9bd3ab9",
