        "id": 5631
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-08T14:08:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right. I think what we have here is good for now... What I was proposing doesn\u0027t require mutating the IR at all (ever). We just change the first condition in SkSLFunctionCall::getProperty to be:\n\n    if (property \u003d\u003d Property::kSideEffects) {\n        return this-\u003efunction().definition() !\u003d nullptr;\n    }\n    \nBut like I said - that will give results that change over time (after we see a prototype, but before we see the definition).",
      "parentUuid": "91ef2ba8_4bcf7ef1",
      "revId": "e642e21d20391a291cb2da1519b85e7ba9bd3ab9",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
